---

15. Conclusion

The Requirement Analysis Phase establishes the complete requirements for LegalEase: AI-Powered Legal Document Generator. It identifies the functional and non-functional requirements, hardware and software needs, AI requirements, security considerations, user workflow, and project limitations.

The finalized requirements provide a strong foundation for the next stage, the Project Design Phase, where the system architecture, database design, user interface, AI workflow, and overall system structure will be designed.
